pan></nav><div tabindex=\"0\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"job-overview\" id=\"overview\" class=\"_description_5yu8i_201 ashby-job-posting-description-container  _container_f7cvd_28\" data-highlight=\"none\"><div class=\"_descriptionText_5yu8i_201 ashby-job-posting-description\"><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">📍 USA &amp; Canada. Remote or in-person SF.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">⏰ Working hours are <strong>PST</strong></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>About Valid</h2><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Founded in July 2023, Valid is a seed-stage company operating at Series A scale, headquartered in San Francisco.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">In under two years, we’ve grown from 5 people to 40+, deployed over $1B in ad spend, and built a full-stack, tech-enabled advertising company serving enterprise consumer customers.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">We’re well-capitalized and backed by top Silicon Valley investors including Canaan, Neo, and others.</p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>The Role</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">A customer obsessed marketing strategist</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">First in line to try the newest AI marketing tools</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Passionate about ad networks and performance marketing strategy</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Obsessed with discovering and tracking social media trends</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Customer obsessed (we put it in their twice on purpose!)</p></li></ul><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><em>We believe that the best form of marketing is AI-assisted, data-driven and human in-the-loop. This role is for an analyst who can interface with the client to help set and execute user acquisition strategies.</em></p><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\"></p><h2>Responsibilities</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Own performance marketing account management for app clients.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Execute media planning confidently across paid social (Meta, TikTok, Snapchat) and paid search (ASA, Google UAC) channels.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Orchestrate creative production and manage the end-to-end flow until assets are launched in ad accounts.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Own, ideate, and iterate on creative testing frameworks tailored to each app’s context.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Engage in internal &amp; external communication to collaborate with cross-functional teams and present campaign reports to stakeholders and clients.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Analyze campaign data using strong analytical skills and derive actionable insights to improve performance.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Contribute to growth marketing discussions on LTV/CAC, payback periods, MRR/ARR, run rates, and more.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Use MMPs and analytics dashboards for reporting, and collaborate with the Valid product team on data management best practices.</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Conduct A/B &amp; multivariate testing to improve performance and generate insights.</p></li></ul><h2>Required Qualifications</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">2–3 years of growth marketing or user acquisition experience</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">1–2 years of app performance marketing experience, primarily paid social UA (this will be tested)</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Hands-on experience with MMPs like AppsFlyer, Adjust, Singular, Branch, Kochava, or AirBridge</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Proficient in iOS app attribution and well-versed in SKAdNetwork, ATT, and probabilistic attribution (this will be tested)</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Strong familiarity with paid media campaigns specific to apps: Meta AEM, TikTok ADC, Google UAC</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Track record of managing iOS app campaigns that optimize for CPA, ROAS, and LTV</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Able to multitask and prioritize effectively in a fast-paced environment</p></li></ul><h2>Preferred Qualifications</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Industry Expertise: Actively learns and shares new industry insights</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Experience with consumer subscription apps</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Freemium model familiarity for subscription apps</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Understanding of user onboarding flows and paywall testing</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Adaptability to platform changes, including iOS and social media algorithms</p></li></ul><h2>What You’ll Be Getting</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Work on a global team with flexibility and a collaborative startup culture</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Annual company offsite - we gather in a new location each year to connect and celebrate</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation Range</h2><ul style=\"min-height:1.5em\"><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Competitive salary based on experience and location</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Benefits: 401k, healthcare, FSA, lunch (for in-person days)</p></li><li><p style=\"min-height:1.5em\">Location: Remote friendly in USA or Canada with a preference for in-person out of our office in San Francisco.</p></li></ul></div><a class=\" _container_j2da7_1\" href=\"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/Valid/b712b932-41ba-4503-9c79-7b0e8605cda8/application\"><button class=\"_button_zyh3g_28 _primary_zyh3g_97  _greedy_zyh3g_221  \">Apply for this Job</button></a></div></div></div></div><footer class=\"_container_1jx4x_28 \"><a href=\"https://www.ashbyhq.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"_powered_1jx4x_58\" aria-label=\"Learn more about Ashby\"><span>Powered b