me\":\"Valid\",\"publicWebsite\":\"https://valid.co\",\"customJobsPageUrl\":null,\"hostedJobsPageSlug\":\"Valid\",\"allowJobPostIndexing\":true,\"isDemoOrg\":false,\"theme\":{\"colors\":{\"version\":\"1\",\"colorPrimary600\":\"#102930\",\"colorPrimary900\":\"#102930\"},\"showJobFilters\":false,\"showLocationAddress\":false,\"showTeams\":false,\"showAutofillApplicationsBox\":true,\"logoWordmarkImageUrl\":\"https://app.ashbyhq.com/api/images/org-theme-wordmark/619465f9-42b1-4ed6-a742-c0093be332f3/c2e32b0e-a20c-4833-86f7-5e980d568641/4d49034a-2f73-4359-908f-8e40d4a26b33.png\",\"logoSquareImageUrl\":\"https://app.ashbyhq.com/api/images/org-theme-logo/619465f9-42b1-4ed6-a742-c0093be332f3/c2e32b0e-a20c-4833-86f7-5e980d568641/dbab9b31-a3f4-477c-83fd-111920d7d29e.png\",\"applicationSubmittedSuccessMessage\":null,\"jobBoardTopDescriptionHtml\":\"<h1><strong>Build the future of advertising.</strong></h1><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">We’re building an AI-native marketing company where creative, media buying, and engineering work together to help brands grow faster.</p><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Valid sits at the intersection of performance marketing, AI video, creative strategy, and software. We’re replacing the traditional agency model with something faster, smarter, and more accountable.</p><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">We care deeply about taste, speed, ownership, and results. We’re looking for people who love making things, testing them in the real world, and improving them quickly.</p><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">We care far more about what you’ve built, how you think, and how hard you push than about perfect resumes or polished interview answers.</p><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">If you’re a marketer, engineer, creative, filmmaker, strategist, or operator who:</p><ul style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\"><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Loves ads, growth, and internet culture</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Is excited by AI as a creative and operating tool</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Thrives in fast, high-ownership environments</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Wants to help define the next generation of marketing</p></li></ul><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">…you’re in the right place.</p><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">We’ve grown quickly, work with ambitious brands, and are building a team of people who want to do the best work of their careers.</p>\",\"jobBoardBottomDescriptionHtml\":\"<p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Don't see your role? Email hello@valid.co</p>\",\"jobPostingBackUrl\":null,\"__typename\":\"Theme\"},\"appConfirmationTrackingPixelHtml\":null,\"recruitingPrivacyPolicyUrl\":null,\"activeFeatureFlags\":[\"AiNotetakerCandidateConsentPolicies\",\"ApplicationForReferrals\",\"ApprovalNotesFromEmail\",\"BookingLinkRescheduleLimits\",\"CanonicalizeSchools\",\"CoreMultipleBrands\",\"CoreMultipleBrandsFeedFiltering\",\"CoreMultipleBrandsLinkedInJobWrappingStreamingFix\",\"DemoOrgBanners\",\"EducationHistoryFormField\",\"ExplicitAutomatedProcessingOptOutConfirmation\",\"JobBoardCookieConsentControls\",\"JobBoardEtagValidation\",\"JobPostingApplicationDeadlines\",\"JobPostingListV2\",\"JobPostingWorkplaceTypeOverrideSecondaryLocationsToo\",\"LinkedInIntegrationRequireCompanyId\",\"LinkedInTOSUpdate\",\"LocationExternalName\",\"MigrateGoogleRecaptchaAutomatedLegal\",\"RejectBase64EncodedResumesFrontEnd\",\"RejectBase64EncodedResumesThrowErrorFrontEnd\",\"RejectInvalidFileTypeOnUpload\",\"RejectUrlsInCandidateName\",\"SchedulingCandidateAvailabilityNote\",\"SchedulingDirectBookingLogDirectBookingEventsJson\",\"SchedulingGCalSendUpdatesForCancelEvents\",\"SchedulingRescheduleAndCancellationReasonsNonUser\",\"SchedulingUseLocaleInTimeFormatting\",\"ShowCountsOnJobBoardFilterOptions\",\"SocialSharingHtmlMetaSettings\",\"UseGlobalQueryScopesOnGlobalApplicationQuestions\",\"UseGoogleRecaptchaUniversalKey\",\"UseJobPostingFiltersOnGlobalApplicationQuestions\",\"UseJobPostingFiltersOnGlobalApplicationQuestionsUI\",\"UseJobPostingFiltersOnSurveys\",\"UseJobPostingFiltersOnSurveysUI\",\"ValidateFileTypeOnUpload\"],\"timezone\":\"America/Los_Angeles\",\"candidateScheduleCancellationReasonRequirementStatus\":\"Optional\",\"showCookieBanner\":false,\"__typename\":\"Organization\"},\"posting\":{\"id\":\"b712b932-41ba-4503-9c79-7b0e8605cda8\",\"title\":\"App, Performance Marketing Analyst\",\"departmentName\":\"Agency\",\"departmentExternalName\":\"Agency\",\"locationName\":\"Remote or SF\",\"locationAddress\":null,\"workplaceType\":null,\"employmentType\":\"FullTime\",\"descriptionHtml\":\"<p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">📍 USA &amp; Canada. Remote or in-person SF.</p><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">⏰ Working hours are <strong>PST</strong></p><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\"></p><h2>About Valid</h2><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Founded in July 2023, Valid is a seed-stage company operating at Series A scale, headquartered in San Francisco.</p><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">In under two years, we’ve grown from 5 people to 40+, deployed over $1B in ad spend, and built a full-stack, tech-enabled advertising company serving enterprise consumer customers.</p><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">We’re well-capitalized and backed by top Silicon Valley investors including Canaan, Neo, and others.</p><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\"></p><h2>The Role</h2><ul style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\"><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">A customer obsessed marketing strategist</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">First in line to try the newest AI marketing tools</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Passionate about ad networks and performance marketing strategy</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Obsessed with discovering and tracking social media trends</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Customer obsessed (we put it in their twice on purpose!)</p></li></ul><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\"></p><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\"><em>We believe that the best form of marketing is AI-assisted, data-driven and human in-the-loop. This role is for an analyst who can interface with the client to help set and execute user acquisition strategies.</em></p><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\"></p><h2>Responsibilities</h2><ul style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\"><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Own performance marketing account management for app clients.</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Execute media planning confidently across paid social (Meta, TikTok, Snapchat) and paid search (ASA, Google UAC) channels.</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Orchestrate creative production and manage the end-to-end flow until assets are launched in ad accounts.</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Own, ideate, and iterate on creative testing frameworks tailored to each app’s context.</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Engage in internal &amp; external communication to collaborate with cross-functional teams and present campaign reports to stakeholders and clients.</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Analyze campaign data using strong analytical skills and derive actionable insights to improve performance.</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Contribute to growth marketing discussions on LTV/CAC, payback periods, MRR/ARR, run rates, and more.</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Use MMPs and analytics dashboards for reporting, and collaborate with the Valid product team on data management best practices.</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Conduct A/B &amp; multivariate testing to improve performance and generate insights.</p></li></ul><h2>Required Qualifications</h2><ul style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\"><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">2–3 years of growth marketing or user acquisition experience</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">1–2 years of app performance marketing experience, primarily paid social UA (this will be tested)</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Hands-on experience with MMPs like AppsFlyer, Adjust, Singular, Branch, Kochava, or AirBridge</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Proficient in iOS app attribution and well-versed in SKAdNetwork, ATT, and probabilistic attribution (this will be tested)</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Strong familiarity with paid media campaigns specific to apps: Meta AEM, TikTok ADC, Google UAC</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Track record of managing iOS app campaigns that optimize for CPA, ROAS, and LTV</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Able to multitask and prioritize effectively in a fast-paced environment</p></li></ul><h2>Preferred Qualifications</h2><ul style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\"><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Industry Expertise: Actively learns and shares new industry insights</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Experience with consumer subscription apps</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Freemium model familiarity for subscription apps</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Understanding of user onboarding flows and paywall testing</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Adaptability to platform changes, including iOS and social media algorithms</p></li></ul><h2>What You’ll Be Getting</h2><ul style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\"><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Work on a global team with flexibility and a collaborative startup culture</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Annual company offsite - we gather in a new location each year to connect and celebrate</p></li></ul><h2>Compensation Range</h2><ul style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\"><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Competitive salary based on experience and location</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Benefits: 401k, healthcare, FSA, lunch (for in-person days)</p></li><li><p style=\\\"min-height:1.5em\\\">Location: Remote friendly in USA or Cana